{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12695","headline":"别何员外 · 元结","name":"别何员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁能守清躅，谁能嗣世儒。\n吾见何君饶，爲人有是夫。\n黜官二十年，未曾暂崎岖。\n终不病贫贱，寥寥无所拘。\n忽然逢知己，数月领官符。\n犹是尚书郎，收赋来江湖。\n人皆悉苍生，随意极所须。\n比盗无兵甲，似偷又不如。\n公能独宽大，使之力自输。\n吾欲探时谣，爲公伏奏书。\n但恐抵忌讳，未知肯听无。\n不然且相送，醉欢於坐隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}